    "message": "Hold the project worker while checking what submit() reads\n\nThe test asserted that submit() loads no checkpoint, but the worker\nthread could start the computation and load it before the assertion\nran, which failed 2 of 10 full runs (#145). The test now occupies the\nsingle-worker pool with a task waiting on an event, checks the loads,\nand only then lets the computation run. With a sleep after submit() the\nold test failed every time and the new one passes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
